message: "Please cite this experiment and the original MCB, PointNeXt, PointNet and PointNet++ papers when reusing this work."
title: "MCB-32: Reproducible Industrial Point Cloud Classification with PointNeXt"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "13536309143"
repository-code: "https://github.com/13536309143/MCB-32-Industrial-Point-Cloud-Classification"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/GeorgeWJJ/PointNext"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-10-16
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  A single-seed industrial CAD point cloud classification experiment comparing
  PointNeXt-S/B/L/XL, PointNet and PointNet++ on a reorganized 32-class MCB
  collection, with nine paired sampling/resolution representations and 192
  recorded evaluations. The software license does not relicense source CAD data.
